# Minimal session for INCURSION_SAVECHANCE_PROBE (inc-o6xj,
# SaveChanceProbe, src/Fight.cpp). The probe runs once, synchronously, at the
# top of Game::Play() -- before the arrival screen chargen.keys leaves up is
# dismissed -- so nothing after chargen.keys matters to the check itself; this
# script only needs a clean, deterministic way into a live map and a clean
# exit.
#
# Read by tools/check_save_chance.sh, which sets INCURSION_SAVECHANCE_PROBE=1
# and reads the probe's own SAVECHANCE lines out of logs/errors.log.

@include chargen.keys

SPACE*80
ESC*20

@quit
